  "description": "Test build of Locke as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Locke so Silver Stake deals extra magic damage on the target's missing health (the main pack: a fixed amount), Soul Ignition burns a share of his current health and heals back most of what it burnt (the main pack: his maximum health, a fixed heal), Purgatory executes marked champions under a share of their maximum health and drops the artifact where one was sealed - picking it up raises the execute line for the whole game and cuts the ult's cooldown (the main pack: an approximation, seals lost on death), takedowns ready Ashen Pursuit, and he wears his W look while Soul Ignition lasts. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
